  <p>
    Residential projects are often the hardest to explain from drawings alone. A buyer,
    family member or approving committee wants to feel the height of the building, the
    relationship between blocks and the quality of the open spaces. A physical model
    answers those questions at a glance.
  </p>
  <p>
    We build residential scale models from your architectural drawings and 3D models,
    at a scale and level of detail suited to how you will use the model. A single villa
